      "source": "Base class for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>s creating <a href=\"ResourceReaderRepositoryPopulator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>ResourceReaderRepositoryPopulator</code></a>s. Sub-classes have to provide\na <a href=\"ResourceReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>ResourceReader</code></a> to hand into the <a href=\"RepositoryPopulator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>RepositoryPopulator</code></a> instance created.",
      "translation": "创建<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a>的基类，该<code>FactoryBean</code>用于创建<a href=\"ResourceReaderRepositoryPopulator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>ResourceReaderRepositoryPopulator</code></a>。子类必须提供一个<a href=\"ResourceReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>ResourceReader</code></a>，并将其传递给所创建的<a href=\"RepositoryPopulator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.init\"><code>RepositoryPopulator</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
